> **Overview**
> Replaces the model popover’s **effort pills** with a **Claude-style slider** (`EffortSlider` + `lib/effortSlider.ts`): same ladder stops and semantics (the default stop still clears effort to `null`), debounced keyboard commits, drag/click behavior, zoom-safe pointer math via `toCss`, and the popover **stays open** while you adjust. Tab order now includes the slider; other keys are contained so Space is not push-to-talk.
